      "rests_on": [],
      "reasoning": "Hilton's debate answers rule out rung 1 ('fully paid for by the public sector'), calling single-payer 'a total disaster', and his Working Class Healthcare Guarantee keeps public programs alongside private insurance, so rung 5 ('stay out of healthcare entirely') is out too. No passage says coverage for everyone (rung 2), an expansion of programs for seniors and low-income residents (rung 3, which his Medi-Cal narrowing cuts against), or help 'only' for the poorest (rung 4), so the evidence shows a side but no rung.",
      "needs_source": [],
      "quotes": [
        {
          "snapshot_id": "4024dbe9-6150-5dbd-8a8f-ba21347d85c6",
          "text": "To bring down premiums, Steve will apply for a Section 1332 State Innovation Waiver under the Affordable Care Act.",
          "v7_tier": "lever",
          "v7_flag": "lever-named",
          "v8_quotable": true,
          "v8_codes": []
        },
        {
          "snapshot_id": "4024dbe9-6150-5dbd-8a8f-ba21347d85c6",
          "text": "For working-age adults who are not seniors or disabled, California will seek federal approval for personal healthcare accounts containing approximately $8,000 to $10,000 a year.",
          "v7_tier": "lever",
          "v7_flag": "lever-named",
          "v8_quotable": true,
          "v8_codes": []
        },
        {
          "snapshot_id": "4024dbe9-6150-5dbd-8a8f-ba21347d85c6",
          "text": "Steve's Working Class Healthcare Guarantee will give them access to coverage with an affordable premium and a low deductible.",
          "v7_tier": "direction",
          "v7_flag": null,
          "v8_quotable": true,
          "v8_codes": []
        },
        {
          "snapshot_id": "3c3ef552-deae-5264-9187-e4e0f0424337",
          "text": "That's why I've announced my plan for a working class healthcare guarantee that will have a low premium and a low deductible by cutting out the waste and the fraud in the system.",
          "v7_tier": "direction",
          "v7_flag": null,
          "v8_quotable": true,
          "v8_codes": []
        },
        {
          "snapshot_id": "92bcee53-75f3-51f7-8b31-d67822ea95bd",
          "text": "As a policy maker, you end up with the worst patient satisfaction, cost that you can't afford, taxes skyhigh to pay for it. It is a total disaster.",
          "v7_tier": "none",
          "v7_flag": null,
          "v8_quotable": false,
          "v8_codes": ["not-forward"]
        },
        {
          "snapshot_id": "c000d7e2-a538-5680-9c40-2bcc9ac5f3ed",
          "text": "Ending state-funded full-scope Medi-Cal for undocumented immigrants: $8.5 billion",
          "v7_tier": "lever",
          "v7_flag": "lever-named",
          "v8_quotable": true,
          "v8_codes": []
        }
      ]
